        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF144 makes <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCDataChannel" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCDataChannel</code></a> transferrable in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1209163" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1209163</a>. It also adds support for the <code class="notranslate">closing</code> event in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1611953" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1611953</a></p>
